    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀηθ-έσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be unaccustomed</i>, c. gen., once in <i><span class="en">
